/**
 * AboutPageChrome.astro — balanced native document chrome for /about/.
 *
 * V10 verification (2026-06-23): the previous FrameBefore/FrameAfter split
 * opened <main>/<div.page-wrap> in one component and closed them in another.
 * Astro serializes component roots independently, so <AboutArticle> became a
 * body-level sibling instead of a child of <main>; that was the real source of
